  <p class="kicker">Welcome to MusicMentor by Joshua Ediale</p>
  <h1>You're in. Thank you.</h1>
  <p class="lead">MusicMentor is my blog for singers who lead. I'm Joshua Ediale, a worship leader, singer, songwriter and vocal coach, and author of <em>The Lead Singer's Handbook</em>. I've led music since 2009, and these notes come from that work.</p>
  <p>You've joined a list of singers who lead and want to keep growing: lead vocalists, worship leaders, choir members and anyone who wants to sing with more control and confidence.</p>
  <h2 class="sec">What you'll get</h2>
  <ul class="perks">
    <li><strong>Every new note by email.</strong> Practical posts on your voice, your team and your congregation, sent as they go live. No need to go looking.</li>
    <li><strong>First access.</strong> When I release a guide, a training or a new resource for singers, subscribers hear first, before I announce it anywhere else.</li>
    <li><strong>Notes I only send by email.</strong> Now and then, something short that doesn't make it to the blog.</li>
